  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Governance Accountability</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Lokal demokratiutveckling</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med Governance Accountability Program, GAP, &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra och st&#xe4;rka funktionen och system inom cirka fyrtio kommuner i BiH samt att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra policyramverket f&#xf6;r effektivitet och ansvarighet inom den lokala f&#xf6;rvaltningen. Projektet samfinansieras med USAID.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Governance Accountability Program, GAP, is to improve and strengthen the operations and systems of approximately forty municipal governments in BiH and improve the policy framework for efficient and accountable governance. The project is co-financed with USAID.</narrative>
  </description>
